{% macro event(value) -%}
{% if value == 'work_update' -%}
The supplied activity and findings describe this work.
{%- elif value == 'permission_request' -%}
The work is waiting for the developer to approve an operation.
{%- elif value == 'input_requested' -%}
The work is waiting for an answer to a question.
{%- elif value == 'waiting' -%}
The work is waiting for input.
{%- elif value == 'failed_call' -%}
An operation reported a failure.
{%- elif value == 'turn_ended' -%}
An execution of this work ended. The reported outcome describes that execution, not whether the whole task is complete.
{%- elif value == 'request_received' -%}
The developer sent a message about this work.
{%- elif value == 'quiet_time' -%}
No work is confirmed to be executing. Earlier tasks may still be unfinished.
{%- elif value == 'quiet_check_in' -%}
The work session remains open. No new activity has been observed.
{%- elif value == 'tool_running' -%}
A tool call is still running. Its result is not known yet.
{%- elif value == 'pet_clicked' -%}
The developer clicked you for a conversation about the supplied work.
{%- elif value == 'pet_clicked_idle' -%}
The developer clicked you. No work is confirmed to be executing.
{%- elif value == 'recollection' -%}
This is a quiet moment to recall earlier work. The supplied memories describe earlier observations.
{%- elif value == 'explicit_context' -%}
The developer supplied context for a reaction.
{%- elif value == 'request' -%}
The developer supplied a request or follow-up.
{%- elif value == 'reported_progress' -%}
A report describes progress on this work.
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro outcome(value) -%}
{% if value == 'success' -%}
The work segment ended without a reported execution error. This alone does not establish task completion.
{%- elif value == 'error' -%}
The work segment ended with a reported execution error.
{%- elif value == 'cancelled' -%}
The work segment was cancelled. The report may describe partial progress.
{%- elif value == 'stale' -%}
The execution status became stale; its result is unknown.
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro activity(value) -%}
{% if value == 'investigating' -%}
code investigation
{%- elif value == 'editing' -%}
code editing
{%- elif value == 'testing' -%}
test execution
{%- elif value == 'building' -%}
build execution
{%- elif value == 'checking' -%}
work verification
{%- elif value == 'command' -%}
command execution
{%- elif value == 'source' -%}
coding tool execution
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro state(value) -%}
{% if value == 'working' -%}
A work turn is open. This alone does not establish current progress.
{%- elif value == 'quiet' -%}
No current execution is confirmed for this work.
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}
